r the age of 18."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cAttention, passengers. This train will now be terminating at Sylvan Station. We apologize for any inconvenience, and we thank you for traveling with us tonight.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When returning home from the grocer's one quiet evening, Tera is taken away to Sylvan Station, a place you won\u2019t find on any route or map. Amidst the wither and rot of the station, she meets another passenger who warns her of horrors impending and urges her to run. The night of terror is about to begin...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Horror Gameplay in Visual Novel Form</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore Sylvan Station, you will add items to your inventory, hide from danger, and face monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engrossing Narrative</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself to two plus hours of razor-sharp horror storytelling, complete with unforgettable characters and a setting that will haunt your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Environments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photorealistic backgrounds will draw you into the harrowing world of Sylvan Station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vivid Character Art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn sprites express a gallery of emotions, ranging from fear to fury, loneliness to lust, and sadness to joy.</p>","developers":["Calamity Maid"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007780/e0a2e81c20b837e592f1f9cbbf7f1dcba0562b79/header.jpg?t=1760585276","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Calamity Maid, 2025. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements